# mosley_vape_quest_one
# Giver: Councillor Mosley (Preset_CouncillorMosley). Sends the player into a new basement/attic
# interior to clear Neeks and kill the Tortured Neek for his vape (CherryMangoVape.asset).
#
# ⚠ MOSLEY'S CONVERSATION IS NOT IN THIS FILE — it is quests/dialogue/councillormosley.quest.
# That file owns every line he says, across every quest: one DIALOGUE block per npcId across the
# whole quests/ tree, because each import regenerates Dialogue_councillormosley.asset wholesale
# and a second declaration would clobber the first. This quest's GRANT: and COMPLETE: both live
# there, as does the GRANT: for daniel_pauls_quest_one.
#
# ⚠ Tools -> Content -> Validate Quests only looks for a COMPLETE: inside the quest's own file,
# so it reports this quest's Collect last stage as having no completion route. That is a blind
# spot in the validator, not a hole in the quest.
#
# See docs/reference/QUEST_TEXT_FORMAT.md for the full format.
# Import with  Tools -> Content -> Import Quests  (after finishing this file and the prerequisites
# below are in place).

QUEST mosley_vape_quest_one
TITLE: Chemical Castration Gone Wrong
GIVER: Councillor Mosley
LOCATION: Mosley's Lab Basement
STAGE KILL tortured_neek x1
OBJECTIVE: [TODO: clear the basement and kill the Tortured Neek]
STAGE COLLECT cherry_mango_vape x1
OBJECTIVE: [TODO: find his vape]
WHENMET: [TODO: take the vape back to Mosley]
REWARD
POUNDS: 40
XP: 80
